  designNotes: 'Trend for 3 Days, Volcano Lair: each Day (from the Day it''s set),
    on each side the strongest creature hides in a lair: it''s Untouchable that Day,
    as long as another creature of its side stands. Every villain gets one: play
    it when your boss is the one worth hiding.'
  artDescription: 'A cutaway of a volcano with a sleek steel base inside: a monorail,
    a rocket on its launch pad, henchmen in matching jumpsuits, and at the top a
    bald man in a grey tunic stroking a white cat on a throne behind armored glass.'
